lf.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/23/moelis-company-mc-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2018 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2018-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"Our revenue strength was driven primarily by continued growth in M&A and our restructuring business continues to benefit from strong positioning and market share with both sequential and year over year growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/22/moelis-company-mc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2018 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2018-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"With all products contributing, including restructuring which continues to be a steady contributor, we achieved record third quarter revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/22/moelis-company-mc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2018 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Moelis","x":"Our full year revenue growth was driven by a greater number of transaction completions with higher average fees across all products and record revenues in M&A, restructuring and private funds advisory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/moelis-company-mc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2018 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Moelis","x":"Our restructuring franchise achieved record revenues, despite a low default rate environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/moelis-company-mc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"Restructuring activity declined slightly, but continues to be a steady part of our overall business and was ranked number one both in the US and worldwide for completed transactions during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/moelis-company-mc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Moelis","x":"Yeah, but you know, probably statistically and significantly slower, it has been pretty rock solid. the teams are ranked number one, we love our restructuring business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/moelis-company-mc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"This compares with the overall M&A market in which the number of global M&A completions greater than $100 million declined 22% from the prior year, while our M&A related activity was down for the quarter our restructuring business continue to be a strong contributor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/moelis-company-mc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"In the second quarter, Moelis was ranked number one in global and US restructuring completions by value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/moelis-company-mc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Moelis","x":"…quarter if processes take a long time, the market, if the Fed did the wrong things or China trade war went the wrong way, my guess is people were unsure that the market was sustainable and didn't want to start what could be a six-month process into a market, in which valuations wouldn't be…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/moelis-company-mc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Moelis","x":"Interestingly, we've come through all that; the fed, the trade war, S&Ps at all-time highs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/moelis-company-mc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Simon","x":"Restructuring had its largest quarter of activity since inception and Moelis was ranked number one in both global and U.S. restructuring completions by value and number of transactions in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/moelis-company-mc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Moelis","x":"Restructuring continues to be a growing and significant part of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/moelis-company-mc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"We experienced higher average fees in both M&A and restructuring during 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/moelis-company-mc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2019 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"Our restructuring franchise achieved record revenues for the full year, surpassing last year's peak level of activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/moelis-company-mc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth David Moelis","x":"We have the best restructuring and capital solutions team in the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/moelis-company-mc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Walter Simon","x":"At the same time, our restructuring business, coupled with our capital markets capabilities has experienced a tremendous increase in mandates recently, and we feel very confident about its longer-term contribution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/moelis-company-mc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Walter Simon","x":"These revenues primarily came from a strong increase in our capital markets activity and a meaningful uptick in retainer fees, primarily related to restructuring mandates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/moelis-company-mc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth David Moelis","x":"In these cases, our leading restructuring franchise will continue to win new assignments and be a strong contributor to revenues over the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/moelis-company-mc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"Our restructuring-related activity was the highest it's ever been exceeding last year's record third quarter contribution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/moelis-company-mc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"In addition, our restructuring retainers remain significantly elevated over the prior year, and our capital markets business continues to make a steady contribution to revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/moelis-company-mc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"We produced record levels of capital markets and restructuring activity and near records in M&A despite the softer deal-making landscape in the first half of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/moelis-company-mc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2020 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"By the way, restructuring had a very good year too, but it was pretty much in line with our percentages in all other years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/moelis-company-mc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Walter Simon","x":"We also continue to see strong levels of restructuring and capital markets activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/moelis-company-mc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth David Moelis","x":"Our restructuring team remains an active and steady contributor even with the backdrop of a healthier global economy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/moelis-company-mc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Simon","x":"The robust growth during the second quarter was primarily attributable to increased levels of transaction completions with particular strength in M&A. In addition, our restructuring and capital markets teams remain very active as our model truly has three powerful revenue engines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/moelis-company-mc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"We always say restructuring is 20% to 25% of our total revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/moelis-company-mc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Simon","x":"In addition, our restructuring and capital markets were strong contributors as our model truly has three powerful revenue engines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/moelis-company-mc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2021 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Moelis","x":"I think the restructuring franchise is a global one.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/moelis-company-mc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"You had real concerns about tariffs and how they would affect industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/moelis-mc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"…into private credit is that the marginal company that would go through a liability management or restructuring gets purchased in an M&A deal or refinanced. So I think we've always tried to put our capital markets kind of together with our restructuring business in the numbers because I do think,","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/moelis-mc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q2","e":"mc","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Moelis","x":"So I think we've always tried to put our capital markets kind of together with our restructuring business in the numbers because I do think, you know, it's sort of a choice.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/moelis-mc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Christopher Callesano","x":"The main drivers of the expense growth during the first nine months of the year were increased deal-related T&E and client conferences, continued investments in technology and data, including AI, and higher occupancy costs as a result of headcount growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"…in parts of healthcare and industrials and in sports media and entertainment and the world of data centers and AI and digital infrastructure and we're seeing it I'll say, pretty much across the board in terms of industries where we're seeing activity, M&A, pipeline building, etcetera,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"This activity is supported by improved clarity around trade policy and tariffs, and an accommodative regulatory environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"But I do think, to your point, while it's still early days, I do think that disruption is going to create opportunities for us on the restructuring side as the rollout of AI and the impact on AI becomes apparent in corporate P&Ls.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"Look, we as I think you all know, we have an outstanding practice in TSA and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"It's obviously early days there in terms of the direct disruption AI is going to have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Kenneth Brooks Worthington","x":"One of the narratives in the market is the disruptive nature of AI, particularly in parts of the tech sector.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/moelis-mc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"The main drivers of the expense growth for the year were increased deal-related T&E and client conferences, continued investments in technology and data, including AI and higher occupancy costs due to headcount growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"You had tariffs and inflation and all of those things that make it hard to underwrite a purchase of those kinds of companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"But I think some of those companies are going to tip in to more active in-court restructuring assignments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"And in other parts of the ecosystem, although we haven't seen yet there's not 1 example I can point to where AI has created a restructuring opportunity in the near term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"As we talked about earlier, I think in a lot of different parts of the economy in different industries, AI disruption technology shifts are accelerate of M&A activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2025 Q4","e":"mc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Brendan O'Brien","x":"To start, Naved, you alluded to this a bit in your prepared remarks, but just 1 of the big topics of discussion at the moment is AI disruption and the potential implications for the outlook for M&A activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/moelis-mc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"Demand for growth capital from high-quality issuers is driving activity in our business, particularly in late-stage growth and pre-IPO issuance for AI, digital infrastructure and aerospace and defense oriented business models, just to name a few.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Christopher Callesano","x":"As previously communicated, we currently anticipate our full year 2026 noncompensation expenses grow at a similar rate to 2025 due to our ongoing investments in technology, including AI, increased deal-related travel expenses and growth in headcount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"Look, on the outlook for restructuring generally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"And we think over time, liability management will turn into more traditional restructuring as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"While the war in the Middle East, disruptions in private credit and the impact of AI on certain sectors, have created some near-term headwinds in parts of the transactional environment, the same forces create new opportunities for our firm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q1","e":"mc","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"There will be companies that -- where the AI threat is misperceived these companies will adapt and use AI to their advantage and prosper and grow through some of this disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/moelis-mc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"…to build scale, strengthen market positioning, and enhance growth continues to create demand for M&A. While we are mindful of risks such as higher market volatility, geopolitical tensions, higher rates, and uncertainty surrounding AI infrastructure financing, our client activity remains strong.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/moelis-mc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MC 2026 Q3","e":"mc","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Navid Mahmoodzadegan","x":"Underlying client demand remains strong across both public and private markets, as unprecede